# Testing Standards

## Backend (Python)

```bash
cd python-backend
pytest
pytest tests/test_auth.py
```

- Use parameterized queries only (no string concatenation in SQL)
- Mock external services (Twilio, LLM API)
- Set `DATABASE_URL` for tests (e.g. `postgresql://localhost:5432/test`)

## Frontend (React/Vitest)

```bash
cd frontend
npm run test:run
npm run test:coverage
```

- Use `test:run` for CI (non-interactive)
- Use `test` for watch mode during development

## IVR / Webhook Testing

- Use `npm run debug:webhook` to simulate Twilio requests
- Use `npm run debug:twiml` to validate TwiML output
- Set `TWILIO_SKIP_VALIDATION=true` only in dev

## Security Checklist for New Code

- [ ] Input validation (Pydantic)
- [ ] Input sanitization (`security.sanitize_input`)
- [ ] Parameterized DB queries
- [ ] Auth/authorization checks
- [ ] No stack traces in production responses
